  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1eeb1506-d9dc-471a-b08b-ea9fc9bce88f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Clustering Single-cell RNA sequencing data using Autoencoder and Kmeans\n",
    "\n",
    "The lecture utilises single-cell RNA-seq data from \"[scMAE: a masked autoencoder for single-cell RNA-seq clustering](https://doi.org/10.1093/bioinformatics/btae020)\". The lecture is divided into the following categories:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Learn about raw single-cell data\n",
    "2. Preprocessing raw data using [Scanpy](https://scanpy.readthedocs.io/en/stable/index.html)\n",
    "3. Methods\n",
    "    - Autoencoder\n",
    "    - KMeans\n",
    "4. Train autoencoder model\n",
    "5. Cluster low-dimensional representation"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 200,
   "id": "f2231d46",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import warnings\n",
    "from IPython.display import Image, display\n",
    "warnings.filterwarnings(action='ignore')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 201,
   "id": "d6136d07",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
